What is Robotics
-Interdisciplinary field that combines Engineering, Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Electronics
-A programmable machine capable of carrying out tasks automatically or semi-automatically

Example of Robot Kits
-Lego EV3
-LEgo Spike Prime
