Core Principle (IPO)
Input - Sensors Gathering Data
Process - Controller decides what to do
Output - Actuators perform the action

Key Concepts
-Sequence - Step-by-Step instruction (algorithm)
-Conditionals (IF-ELSEIF-ELSE)
-Loops - Repeat Actions
-Variables - Store Information

